Third-party material
--------------------

Vendored upstream manifests and charts keep their own licenses; each is listed
here with its source, version and license when it is added.

- k3s-ansible (https://github.com/k3s-io/k3s-ansible), Apache-2.0. The roles
  prereq, k3s_server and k3s_agent are a modified, trimmed copy, last synced
  with commit 5f06791; roles/k3s_server/README.md lists the changes.
- system-upgrade-controller v0.21.0
  (https://github.com/rancher/system-upgrade-controller), Apache-2.0.
  roles/k3s_upgrader/files/: release YAML, with a checked edit to the
  Deployment.
- MetalLB v0.16.2 (https://github.com/metallb/metallb), Apache-2.0.
  roles/metallb/files/metallb-native.yaml: release manifest, unchanged
  apart from the header comment.
- Traefik Helm chart 42.3.1 (https://github.com/traefik/traefik-helm-chart),
  Apache-2.0. roles/traefik_install/files/crds/: the chart's CRDs, verbatim.
- prometheus-operator v0.94.2
  (https://github.com/prometheus-operator/prometheus-operator), Apache-2.0.
  roles/prometheus_operator/files/bundle.yaml: release bundle, namespace
  changed to monitoring.
- kube-prometheus (https://github.com/prometheus-operator/kube-prometheus),
  Apache-2.0. roles/kube_state_metrics/templates/: manifests based on its
  kube-state-metrics component, templated (source version not recorded).
